<title>CHILE: Chile's Mantos Blancos 9-month net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Mantos Blancos 9-month net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copper mining company Empresa Minera de Mantos Blancos SA reported the following results in the first nine months of 1996 against the same period 1995.</p>
<p>			    9-mo 1996	   9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		   US$11.1   profit   US$4.7</p>
<p>Operating profit		20.8   profit     17.1</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	     7.5   loss	 10.8</p>
<p>Total revenues		 166.5		 119.8</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>Mantos Blanco is the only large copper producer trading on the Santiago bourse. It is 75 percent owned by Minorco.</p>
</text>
